<%# Tokenisation intro (player only): tells respondents up front that they'll
    earn points per question, and previews the token types on offer — required
    reading before they answer anything, since answers can't be changed
    afterwards to earn more (see PlayerController#locked_merge).

    Rendered on whichever card Survey#token_intro_card_cid names. It was
    hardcoded onto the welcome card, which is a problem for a deck whose welcome
    card is already busy — or has been deleted. The default is still the welcome
    card, so an existing Verto looks exactly as it did. %>
<div class="welcome-intake">
  <div class="welcome-intake-tokens">
    <div class="welcome-intake-tokens-note">🎯 <%= t("player.tokens_welcome_note") %></div>
    <% if @survey.token_types.any? %>
      <div class="welcome-intake-token-types">
        <% @survey.token_types.each do |tt| %>
          <span class="welcome-token-type-pill"><%= tt["icon"] %> <%= tt["name"] %></span>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
    <%# The board is announced where the points promise already lands, so
        respondents know before playing that there's something to climb.
        leaderboard-tease adds no styling of its own — the note's amber is the
        readable colour on this light pill (brand primary is not; see the
        comment beside .leaderboard-tease in application.css). %>
    <% if @survey.leaderboard_enabled? %>
      <div class="welcome-intake-tokens-note leaderboard-tease">🏆 <%= t("player.leaderboard_teaser") %></div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
